"consent_title" = "Before you connect";
"consent_body" = "You can use your own profile without registering. Activating an invitation sends the invitation token, a random installation ID and API token, your device model, platform and app version to ChromVoid at link.chromvoid.com. ChromVoid keeps the device record after you revoke access. The app refreshes the catalog and access tickets with the API token, even in the background. In reports to ChromVoid, nodes count each Hysteria2 connection under your device ID and add one if you are online using VLESS.\n\nYour profile server or managed node carries VPN traffic and can see destination addresses. Local addresses use your regular connection. Listed Russian sites go directly and other public sites use the VPN unless you set a site exception.\n\nCloudflare handles tunneled DNS and connection checks. Yandex resolves names for sites opened directly, with Cloudflare as a fallback. Before the VPN starts, automatic selection can look up node names using system DNS and contact candidates on TCP port 443. Even an unselected node can see your IP address. Wayveil keeps its diagnostic logs on this device and has no advertising or analytics. Only use profiles you trust.";
