"activation_disclosure" = "Activating sends the invitation token, a random installation ID, a separate API token, your device model, platform and app version to ChromVoid at link.chromvoid.com. Every managed node receives the assigned device ID, grant ID, expiry and revocation status when it syncs. ChromVoid keeps each node’s latest activity report to provide access and enforce device limits. Removing access revokes this installation and frees its device slot. The registration stays on the server. See the privacy policy to request deletion.";
